 "summary": "The post-PR surface is canonical and minimal: no compatibility aliases, bodies unexposed with `(rfl)` restatements, general infrastructure (the `List.prod_ofFn_*` identities and the normalised-trace bound) relocated public to its own modules rather than hidden, and the characteristic API complete at every `n` plus the roadmap's named quadrupole products. The `@[simp]` set is confluent on all overlaps I checked, and the collapse lemmas' `Fin.tail` right-hand sides reduce under the default simp set via `Fin.tail_vecCons`.",
